  "body": "At 207m this is one of the larger two level homes in Ara Hills in an affordable price range, with room for a growing family on an easy-care 320m (approx.) freehold section.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is the hub of the home. It's bright, practical and easy to keep an eye on the kids while dinner's on.\r\n\r\nFour double bedrooms . The main bedroom has its own ensuite plus a walk-in wardrobe and a reading nook, and an upstairs bedroom enjoys sea views. A second bathroom and a separate guest toilet mean no queues in the morning.\r\n\r\nThe internal-access tandem garage takes two cars, with room left over for bikes, storage or a home gym. Central air conditioning and a heating keep you comfortable year-round.\r\n\r\n* 207m Floor Area on beautiful level section\r\n* 4 bedrooms with master bedroom deluxe\r\n* 2 bathrooms plus separate guest toilet\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n* Internal-access tandem garage for two cars\r\n* Easy care level established garden with indoor/outdoor flow to huge under-covered deck.\r\n* Central air conditioning and a heating\r\n* In zone for Orewa Primary and Orewa College (buyers to verify)\r\n\r\nAra Hills sits right off the Grand Drive motorway interchange, about 3km from Orewa village, and borders the Nukumea Reserve.",
